    <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-ink/10 self-center"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-wide mb-6">
        Hello! I'm Kevin. Welcome to my... personal whatever. Something that
        lives to just be torn down and rebuilt anytime I want.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-wide text-muted">
        Indie rock and emo music, skateboarding, and too much time on computers.
        Making software and trying to keep it interesting.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div
        class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-ink/10"
      >
        <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted"
          >Location</span
        >
        <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Waco, TX</span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-ink/10"
